1
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:11,290
Kassa! It's match day. Get ready, we're
going together, like old times.

2
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:14,920
Sorry... who are you?

3
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:20,630
It's me... the one you always hug when a
goal goes in!

4
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:23,870
Do you like football?

5
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:31,010
Me? You were the one who loved football.
I came to see you happy.

6
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:39,090
This place... I think I know it.

7
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:44,800
You do. We've sat here together for
fifty years.

8
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:48,520
Goal! Goal!

9
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:52,750
So who are you, anyway?

10
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:57,670
I'm your friend. Today and tomorrow, I'm
by your side.

11
00:01:00,770 --> 00:01:03,280
Who is this man?

12
00:01:03,630 --> 00:01:05,010
It's you.

13
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:08,130
And this one?

14
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,980
It's me.

15
00:01:10,170 --> 00:01:12,100
He looks like a kind friend.

16
00:01:12,450 --> 00:01:13,950
I still am.

17
00:01:15,870 --> 00:01:18,870
Memories may fade. Love and dignity
remain.

18
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:23,370
Dementia isn't just old age. Know the
signs. Get help early. Don't leave them.

19
00:01:23,370 --> 00:01:26,370
Even if he forgets your name, don't
leave his side.
